{
  "id": "code",
  "label": "编程",
  "icon": "⌨️",
  "desc": "11 code 子模式角色流水线 + IDE 工具 + 任务打勾（DEFAULT_CODE_SUB_MODES 单一权威源）",
  "base": "chat",
  "_note": "照抄现状真值：selfDriven=false 即 getPromptHandler:1385 『自驱动不走 code』；aiP1 仍跑（:1477 无模式门）。hotLayerDir/skills/orphanStrip/taskPlan 见散点清单 A/B/G。",
  "features": {
    "memory": {
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "hotLayerDir": "code/active",
        "hotLayerStyle": "full",
        "orphanStrip": true,
        "codeProjectEnv": true
      }
    },
    "teaching": {
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "taskPlanHowto": true,
        "dailyGreeting": false
      }
    },
    "p1": {
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "selfDriven": false,
        "aiP1": true,
        "_note_selfDriven": "[0724 002拍板] selfDriven(自驱动P1词库管线)=实验功能,完全不需要加载,全模式关闭。它会把 conceptnet/swow/activation_terms 等 119MB 词库 JSON 解析成数百MB 进程级永驻缓存(0723 内存2GB案主因)。给未来AI:禁把 selfDriven 改回 true 或绕过声明门直接 import p1_pipeline——实验成熟需 002 拍板;aiP1(检索AI)是正路不依赖JS词库,保持不动。门在 getPromptHandler Phase3 modeFeature(mode,\"p1\")。"
      }
    },
    "websearch": {
      "enabled": true
    },
    "scheduler": {
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "dueJobsInject": false,
        "codeRoundTriggers": true,
        "crossWindowWake": true
      }
    },
    "flowGroup": {
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "stateInject": false
      }
    },
    "ide": {
      "enabled": true
    },
    "taskRunner": {
      "enabled": true
    },
    "preset": {
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "strategy": "submode-chain",
        "submodeSet": "DEFAULT_CODE_SUB_MODES"
      }
    }
  },
  "hooks": {
    "request": [
      {
        "target": "functions:memory",
        "verb": "getPrompt",
        "feature": "memory",
        "slot": "beilu-memory"
      },
      {
        "target": "functions:prompt",
        "verb": "mvuGetPrompt",
        "slot": "beilu-mvu"
      },
      {
        "target": "functions:prompt",
        "verb": "toggleGetPrompt",
        "slot": "beilu-toggle"
      },
      {
        "target": "functions:prompt",
        "verb": "sysinfoGetPrompt",
        "slot": "beilu-sysinfo"
      },
      {
        "target": "functions:prompt",
        "verb": "worldInfo",
        "slot": "beilu-worldbook"
      },
      {
        "target": "functions:prompt",
        "verb": "getPrompt",
        "feature": "preset",
        "slot": "beilu-preset"
      },
      {
        "phase": "tweak",
        "dl": [
          2,
          1,
          0
        ],
        "steps": [
          {
            "target": "functions:prompt",
            "verb": "mvuTweakPrompt",
            "slot": "beilu-mvu"
          },
          {
            "target": "functions:prompt",
            "verb": "wbTweakPrompt",
            "slot": "beilu-worldbook"
          },
          {
            "target": "functions:prompt",
            "verb": "tweakPrompt",
            "feature": "preset",
            "slot": "beilu-preset"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "presetBinding": {
    "strategy": "submode-chain",
    "submodeSet": "DEFAULT_CODE_SUB_MODES",
    "resolvePreset": "active_preset_map[chatId]"
  },
  "cache": {
    "scopeKeys": [
      "mode",
      "chatId"
    ]
  },
  "storage": {
    "root": "getModeCtxDir"
  },
  "_note2": "菜单完整性(步骤4普查): GetPrompt相插件参与者=memory/preset/worldbook/mvu/toggle/sysinfo(经facade)+files/browser/plugin-host(未迁无facade,影子孪生直调不进ModeDef); 相内并发各写各槽=序不影响产物,等价约束只在相位边界"
}
